        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have increased our portfolio of multifamily properties by partnering with third-party developers (“Developers”) to construct the properties on our behalf.",
        "start_character": 8730,
        "end_character": 8887
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate two business segments: the acquisition, development, ownership and management of multifamily properties, and the acquisition, development, ownership and management of commercial properties;",
        "start_character": 11755,
        "end_character": 11955
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From time to time and when we believe it appropriate to do so, we sell land and income-producing properties.",
        "start_character": 6442,
        "end_character": 6550
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we also opportunistically acquire land for future development.",
        "start_character": 6366,
        "end_character": 6441
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In these instances, we determined the location, design, construction budget and initial lease plan for a potential development project (“Development Project”).",
        "start_character": 8888,
        "end_character": 9047
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To ensure that a Development Project was constructed on plan, on time and on budget, we often entered into a convertible loan arrangement with the Developer, whereby we advanced the out-of-pocket capital to the developer at nominal rate of interest with an option to convert the loan into a 100% ownership interest in the entity that held the Development Project for a price equal to development cost.",
        "start_character": 9134,
        "end_character": 9535
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To the extent that we seek to sell any properties, the sales prices for the properties may be affected by competition from other real estate owners and financial institutions also attempting to sell properties in areas where our properties are located, as well as aggressive buyers attempting to dominate or penetrate a particular market.",
        "start_character": 11128,
        "end_character": 11466
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also invest in mortgage notes receivable and in land that is either held for appreciation or development.",
        "start_character": 267,
        "end_character": 375
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have also contracted Pillar to construct multifamily properties on our behalf and to manage land development projects, including Windmill Farms.",
        "start_character": 9536,
        "end_character": 9683
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate high quality multifamily and commercial properties throughout the Southern United States.",
        "start_character": 166,
        "end_character": 266
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000733590-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000733590-26-000004-a34d78e2abb7ba3e",
        "accession_number": "0000733590-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "When we sell properties, we may carry a portion of the sales price, generally in the form of a short-term interest bearing seller-financed note receivable, secured by the property being sold.",
